      "post_subject": "Three-dimensional Displays",
      "content_md": "Hi folks -\n\nIf you are interested in electro-holography or 3-D displays in general, you might want to look into two symposia happening in January 2005.\n\nAs a part of Electronic Imaging 2005:\n\nStereoscopic Displays and Applications\n\n[http://www.stereoscopic.org/2005/program.html](http://www.stereoscopic.org/2005/program.html)\n\nand, as part of Photonics West 2005:\n\nPractical Holography XIX\n\n[http://spie.org/Conferences/Calls/05/pw ... ction=OE22](http://spie.org/Conferences/Calls/05/pw/opto/index.cfm?fuseaction=OE22)\n\nBest,\n\nGregg Favalora\n\n[http://www.actuality-systems.com](http://www.actuality-systems.com)",
